# Path aliases for links that are already out in the world and cannot be changed.
#
# /terms-and-privacy is written into the body of the approved WhatsApp template
# `artbound_intro_v3` — the introduction every collector receives on first
# contact. An approved template's text cannot be edited at Meta, so that URL is
# fixed for the life of the template and every message already delivered still
# points at it. The page itself lives at /legal.
#
# 301 rather than 302: the alias is permanent, and a permanent redirect is what
# lets a browser and any link checker treat /legal as the canonical page.
/terms-and-privacy  /legal  301
